    <!-- ================= FAQs ================= -->
    <h2 class="fontsize-h3"><%= _("FAQs (Frequently Asked Questions)") %></h2>

    <div class="custom-accordion">

      <details>
        <summary><%= _("What is a data management plan (DMP)?") %></summary>
        <p><%= _("A DMP is a written document that articulates strategies and tools that you are planning or using to effectively manage your research data. It addresses data management before, during and after your project and is considered a living document.") %></p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary><%= _("How do I create an account?") %></summary>
        <p><%= _("Visit dmp-pgd.ca. You can create an account using the ‘Create account’ tab or sign in using institutional or social ID. You must confirm your email before accessing the platform.") %></p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary><%= _("Does it cost anything to create an account?") %></summary>
        <p><%= _("No. DMP Assistant is free for researchers and institutions.") %></p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary><%= _("How do I create a DMP?") %></summary>
        <p><%= _("After signing in, select ‘Create plan’, provide a project title, select your organization and template. Once selected, templates cannot be changed.") %></p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary><%= _("How do I share or add collaborators?") %></summary>
        <p><%= _("Use the ‘Share’ tab to invite collaborators and assign permission levels (co-owner, editor, read-only). Contributors can be listed separately but cannot edit.") %></p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary><%= _("How do I export my DMP?") %></summary>
        <p><%= _("Under the Download tab, export your plan as CSV, HTML, PDF, text, DOCX, or JSON. You can customize included components.") %></p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary><%= _("What happens if I move institutions?") %></summary>
        <p><%= _("You can update your organization under ‘Edit profile’. If needed, accounts can be merged by contacting the help desk.") %></p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary><%= _("I can’t find my DMP?") %></summary>
        <p><%= _("You may have created multiple accounts. Contact the help desk to merge accounts if necessary.") %></p>
      </details>

    </div>
